{"id": 1923, "mod": "SXT", "bucket": "long", "gates": ["G7"], "src": "The EAS 316 is a lightweight observation pod that works in the same way as the EAS-1 External Command Seat. Features a 'No key' start button, though that just means that the pilots have normally gone back to the KSC to find the non-existent keys on launch.", "zh": "EAS 316 是一款轻型观测舱，其运作方式与 EAS-1 外部指令座椅相同。虽然配备了“无钥匙”启动按钮，但这通常只意味着飞行员在发射时又跑回 KSC 去找根本不存在的钥匙了。"}
